{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB《璀璨之城》陳瀅「剝光豬」色誘張智霖一幕，因尺度極之大膽，引起網上極大熱議，有些更揚言要作出投訴，而通訊事務管理局（通訊局）今日（16日）回覆截至今日為止，共接獲28宗投訴，當中25宗涉及昨晚(15日)播出的集數，現正按既定程序處理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T14:40:40.764979+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T13:20:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T03:57:57.938022+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T14:38:18.318570+00:00","content_hash":"34d205fc883542f056f47b9572f6760a7bb13a80d943d06db12fe93d8836d943","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}